<section class="section home-faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="container home-faq-grid">
    <aside class="faq-photo-card" aria-labelledby="faq-card-title">
      <picture class="faq-photo-card-media">
        <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/venues/the-westin-cape-town/lobby-640.webp 640w, /assets/images/venues/the-westin-cape-town/lobby-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 420px">
        <img src="/assets/images/venues/the-westin-cape-town/lobby-1280.jpg" srcset="/assets/images/venues/the-westin-cape-town/lobby-640.jpg 640w, /assets/images/venues/the-westin-cape-town/lobby-1280.jpg 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 420px" alt="" width="1280" height="853" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </picture>
      <div class="faq-photo-card-body">
        <span class="faq-photo-card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.5 7.2L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"/></svg></span>
        <h3 id="faq-card-title">Still have questions?</h3>
        <p>Our team will answer anything about destinations, venues, delegates and logistics.</p>
        <a href="/contact#contact-form" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="home-faq-list">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="stripe" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="eyebrow-num">09</span>&nbsp;/ FAQ</p>
      <h2 id="faq-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="home-faq-lead">Answers to the questions we hear most often from organisations planning MICE experiences across Africa.</p>
      <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">What does MICE stand for?<span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">MICE stands for Meetings, Incentives, Conferences and Exhibitions. It covers corporate events, business meetings, incentive travel, conferences and related group programmes.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">Which African destinations do you offer for MICE travel?<span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">We offer MICE programmes across Botswana, Kenya, Namibia, Rwanda, South Africa, Tanzania, Uganda, Zambia and Zimbabwe.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">Can you create a tailor-made MICE programme?<span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">Yes. We design customised programmes based on your group size, objectives, budget, preferred destination, dates and interests.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">Can business events be combined with leisure or safari experiences?<span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">Absolutely. Africa offers excellent opportunities to combine meetings and conferences with safaris, wildlife, cultural experiences, adventure and leisure extensions.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">How do we request a MICE proposal?<span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">Contact us with your destination, preferred dates, number of delegates, type of event, accommodation requirements and any activities you would like to include. We will use this information to develop a tailor-made proposal for your group.</p>
      </details>
      </div>
      <a href="/faq" class="text-link home-faq-more">View all FAQs <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="13 6 19 12 13 18"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

